ll/115193","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115193.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115193.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-06T14:23:24Z"},"body":"Fixes: #115107\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes a bug in the VisualShader editor where duplicating a \"Frame\" node along with its contents would cause the duplicated content nodes to remain attached to the original frame, instead of the newly created one.\r\n\r\nThe Fix: In `VisualShaderEditor::_dup_paste_nodes`, I added a check during the node-to-frame attachment loop. It now uses the connection_remap map to verify if the parent frame ID was also part of the duplication operation. If it was, the code now correctly re-parents the new nodes to the new frame ID.\r\n\r\nBefore (from issue #115107): \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ec70c8e6-f90c-49de-9a5f-e3f1e9ecb470\r\n\r\nAfter (Fix applied):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8a54f81c-0c90-477e-a06b-75195219a6f6\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/go